   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to implement a mobile serveice that will bring financial services to the unbanked poplulation of          Ethiopia. Agreement partner is M-BIRR ICT SERVICES PLC, Org reg no  ElA-lP/20121I2010, Ethiopia.</narrative>
